delete.summary:
Deletes a sponsorship package (organizer only).
Soft-deletes (sets IsActive=false) when sponsors reference the package;
hard-deletes when no sponsors reference it.

post.summary:
Slice 6: clones a preset into a new venue layout owned by the current user.
Supply `eventId` to attach the layout directly to an event you own;
omit to create a personal template.

Slice 9.2: atomic template apply. Mirror of M:LankaConnect.API.Controllers.VenueLayoutsController.ApplyPresetToEvent(LankaConnect.API.Controllers.VenueLayoutsController.ApplyPresetToEventRequest)
for user-saved templates. Single transaction: clones the template, persists,
flips the event into assigned-seating mode pointing at the clone.
